// Teaching template: replace every placeholder before running commands.
// Run one command at a time in the Observability database as its administrator.
// COLLECTOR_CLIENT_ID is the Bicep collectorIdentityClientId output: application
// client ID, NOT collectorIdentityPrincipalId (the service principal object ID).
// TENANT_ID is the Bicep tenantId output. Both values are UUIDs, not secrets.
// If using a different database name, change Observability consistently.

// Inspect existing access before adding a grant.
.show database Observability principals

// Give the cloud collector ingestion access without query or schema permissions.
.add database Observability ingestors ('aadapp=<COLLECTOR_CLIENT_ID>;<TENANT_ID>')

// Verify that the application appears as an ingestor.
.show database Observability principals

// Grafana's separate system-assigned identity receives Viewer on the dedicated
// Fabric workspace through bootstrap-fabric.py --grafana-principal-id. That
// option accepts Grafana's principal OBJECT ID. It is not this collector grant.
